      <div>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-fg mb-4">1. Acceptance of Terms</h2>
        <p>By accessing or using the services provided by Tangle Technologies, Inc. ("Tangle," "we," "us," or "our"), including Tangle-operated websites, applications, and services at tangle.tools and any of its subdomains (*.tangle.tools), together with our APIs and related services (collectively, the "Services"), you agree to be bound by these Terms of Service ("Terms"). If you do not agree, do not use the Services.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-fg mb-4">2. Description of Services</h2>
