        <p>The Services, including software, documentation, and branding, are owned by Tangle and protected by intellectual property laws.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-fg mb-4">7. Payment and Billing</h2>
        <p>Certain Services require payment. Fees are described on our <a href="https://id.tangle.tools/app/plans" class="underline">pricing page</a>. All fees are non-refundable except as required by law or stated in a specific service agreement.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-fg mb-4">8. Service Availability</h2>
        <p>We strive for high availability but do not guarantee uninterrupted service. Scheduled maintenance will be communicated in advance when feasible.</p>
