      <div>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-fg mb-4">12. Disclaimer of Warranties</h2>
        <p>THE SERVICES ARE PROVIDED "AS IS" WITHOUT WARRANTIES OF ANY KIND, EXPRESS OR IMPLIED.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-fg mb-4">13. Indemnification</h2>
        <p>You agree to indemnify Tangle from claims arising from your use of the Services or violation of these Terms.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
